                Tech Innovators : Igniting Brilliance</h1>
            <p>The Technical Club in the ECE Department is a hub of innovation and knowledge, fostering a dynamic environment for students to explore and excel in the realm of technology. This club serves as a platform for aspiring engineers to expand their horizons, engage in hands-on experiences, and stay updated with the latest advancements in the field.  </p>
            <p> Through workshops, seminars, and interactive sessions, the Technical Club equips students with practical skills, problem-solving abilities, and a deeper understanding of cutting-edge technologies. From coding competitions to hardware projects, the club offers diverse opportunities for students to showcase their technical prowess and collaborate with like-minded individuals.</p>
