            <div class="bio" id="event1">
                <p>
                    To engage the neurons of the left brain, the Technical Club of the department organised a fun activity called "The Treasure Hunt" on November 18, 2022. The event started with a "team round," in which the participants were divided into six teams. The team members had to coordinate with each other to decode the riddles. All teams started off very well and were able to decode the puzzles and reach the final destination, where the members of the club awaited for the teams. <br>
                    
                    After a long battle and fierce competition, the three teams that crossed the finish line in the shortest amount of time advanced to the next round. In the second round, the individual logical skills were tested. The participants had to perform individually. In this round, the participants were first required to find the members of the club who would provide them with the next clue for proceeding in the round. As soon as the round started, there was a great run all around the college to find the members. <br>
                    
                    All the hard work leads to glory”, following the same all the clues led to a common riddle for all the participants – “NOBODY GIVES A DAMN ABOUT ME WHETHER I AM RED OR BLUE, SOMETIMES THERE IS NEW INFO SOMETIMES I AM EMPTY JUST LIKE YOUR LOVE LIFE, BUT I AM STILL THERE SHOWING YOU ALL YOUR FUTURE.” Solving which, the contestants got the lead to find the Winner Tag. Treasure Hunt
