                <div class=" ab"  onclick="showDiv('event2')">ENGINEER'S DAY CELEBRATION </div> 
                 <div class="img ab">
                <img src="/images/engineerd.png" alt="">
                </div>
            </div>
           
           
            <div class="bio" id="event2">
                <p>ENGINEER’S DAY CELEBRATION 
                    Engineers play a vital role in the development of a nation. India observes Engineer's Day on September 15 as a mark of remembrance and tribute to Moksha Gundam Visvesvaraya, who is considered as one of the greatest engineers in the country. So, on the occasion of Engineers' Day, the ECE Technical Club organised a quiz competition on 15th September 2022. All the students participated with great enthusiasm and interest. The quiz contest had two rounds: The first round was the "General Aptitude Test," in which 30–40 students participated. <br>
                    
                    out of these ten students qualified for the second round, and the participant who scored the highest marks among these students was declared the first winner. After the first round, Smarth Bhel took first place, and the remaining nine students competed against each other in the second round. The second round was a "quiz round," with all nine students divided into three teams [Team A, Team B, and Team C]. This quiz consisted of five sub-rounds. After the completion of the second round, the members of Team A were the winners and took second place. After the completion of the event, the prizes were distributed by the faculty. The students Swara Sharma, Ananya Sharma, Abhinav and Sakshi from ECE 5th semester delivered wonderful speeches on the occasion of Engineers Day and briefed everyone about the history behind Engineer's Day. The winners of the event were: <br>
                    
                    1st  Shreyansh sood (5th semester) <br>
                    
                    2nd Rishav kaundal (5th semester) <br>
                    
                    3rd Dhruv ( 3rd semester) <br>
                    
                     </p>

                </div> 
         
          
