            <div class="bio" id="event3">
                <p>Creative thinking and innovation are one of the most essential skills one would need in today's technical world.” Following this The Technical Club of the Electronics and Communication Department organized an Idea pitching competition on March 25,2023 under the guidance of Er. Rita Devi (Assistant Professor, ECE Department). A template was shared with the student teams for presenting their solution ideas. The teams were to present their idea in 8 min and 2 minutes were reserved for questions and answers from the panel of judges as well as the audience. <br>

                    In total five teams participated in the competition – The Byte, The Binary Bandits, The Eyebrainers, The Xpark and The Trouble-shooters.

